[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a>\n                                           (left\nside)</p><p>1. Undo the retaining bolts.</p><p>Extract the bonnet release lever.</p><p>2. Disconnect the bonnet release cable.</p><p>3. Remove the bonnet release lever.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2047094.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Connect the bonnet release\ncable to the lever.</p><p>Position the bonnet release lever and tighten\nthe fixing bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753219\">7040L42</a>\n                                           (left side)</p>"]]